        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=# Role\nYou are an expert marketing strategist and data analyst.\nYou specialize in translating performance data into clear, actionable insights and recommendations for executive audiences.\nYour goal is to generate realistic, insightful demo data that looks like it came from a professional marketing performance report.\n\n# Context\nYou are generating demo data for a YouTube walkthrough showing how AI can create a Marketing Performance Report directly from a Google Sheet.\nThe report will summarize results, insights, and next-step recommendations for a company’s marketing efforts.\nIt will be populated into a Google Doc using mustache variables).\n\nThe final output should sound strategic, concise, and executive-friendly.\n\n# Task\nGenerate demo data in valid JSON format that fills the following variables:\n\n{\n  \"executive_summary\": \"\",\n  \"metric_1_name\": \"\",\n  \"metric_1_score\": \"\",\n  \"metric_1_commentary\": \"\",\n  \"metric_2_name\": \"\",\n  \"metric_2_score\": \"\",\n  \"metric_2_commentary\": \"\",\n  \"metric_3_name\": \"\",\n  \"metric_3_score\": \"\",\n  \"metric_3_commentary\": \"\",\n  \"metric_4_name\": \"\",\n  \"metric_4_score\": \"\",\n  \"metric_4_commentary\": \"\",\n  \"key_findings\": \"\",\n  \"recommendations\": \"\"\n}\n\n# Input\n- Company: {{ $json['Company Name'] }}\n- Industry: {{ $json.Industry }}\n- Reporting Period: {{ $json.Industry }}\n- Description: {{ $json.Description }}\n- Ad Spend (USD): {{ $json['Add Spend USD'] }}\n- Website Sessions: {{ $json['Website Sessions'] }}\n- MQLs: {{ $json.MQLs }}\n\n# Output Requirements\n- Format: Valid JSON (no markdown or explanations).\n- Each property is text only (no arrays).\n- Tone: Strategic, confident, and marketing-savvy — as if written by a senior marketing strategist.\n- Executive Summary: 3–5 sentences summarizing performance, notable trends, and overall effectiveness.\n- Metrics:\n  - Provide 4 marketing-relevant metrics (e.g., Campaign ROI, Conversion Rate, Engagement Rate, Lead Quality, Website Performance).\n  - Each metric includes:\n    - A score from 1–10 (decimals allowed).\n    - Commentary (2–4 sentences) analyzing causes, implications, and next steps.\n  - Where useful, reference or infer trends using the provided inputs (ad_spend_usd, website_sessions, mqls).\n- Key Findings: 3–5 concise bullet points summarizing insights or patterns.\n- Recommendations: 3–5 bullet points offering specific, actionable strategies to improve performance next period.\n- No additional commentary or formatting. Output only the JSON object."
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
      },
